01:59:25.480 --> 01:59:30.460
Mä odotin ensiksi mielessäni semmoista Spinal Tap-tyyppistä, kun niiden rumpalit on.

01:59:30.580 --> 01:59:31.600
Inner combustion.

01:59:34.000 --> 01:59:34.800
Spontaneous.

01:59:35.200 --> 01:59:36.580
Spontaneous combustion.

01:59:36.580 --> 01:59:43.320
